<title>UK: Societe Genarale sets warrants on MIB 30 index.</title>
<headline>Societe Genarale sets warrants on MIB 30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Genarale Acceptance NV has issued 25 million call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the MIB 30 index, lead manager Societe Generale Paris said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	23.APR.98		 PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  15700 ITL    ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE INDEX</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 15000 ITL  2462 ITL  11.2 PCT   6.4 X</p>
<p> CALL	 16500 ITL  1678 ITL  15.8 PCT   9.4 X</p>
<p> CALL	 18000 ITL  1054 ITL  21.4 PCT   14.8 X</p>
<p> PUT	  15000 ITL  936  ITL  -1.5 PCT   16.8 X</p>
<p> PUT	  17000 ITL  1770 ITL  -19.6 PCT  8.9 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
